Z||000000||Kasdan||08-22-2001||08:59 AM||||Ok, occasionally when i crank up my 86 GT, SOMETHING squeals...Ive replaced all belts, disconnected the belt to the A/c Compressor, and replaced the Water Pump.  Could it possibly be my alt.?  I havent seen a drop in batery charge durring cranking...although it could also be a bad berring ive heard...HELP!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||08-22-2001||09:25 AM||||Belt loose slipping on a pulley some where.  Check for any sign of glazing on the belts.  It could be that one of the pulleys has some bad bearings and isn't moving too freely, belt slips until it gets moving.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Kasdan||08-22-2001||09:33 AM||||Car is in the shop right now getting some headlight work done, as well as replacing the entire elec. sys.  including all harnesses...ill tell them to check that, as well as throw in a new compressor...windows down dont cool enough, i wish i had t-tops!||||reg||1
